B.aud=new A.vH("BridgePoint welcomes you by profile name and summarizes new evidence, refreshed sources, opportunity changes, alerts, and follow-ups from the last 24 hours.",B.np,"Start with your Daily Brief")
B.au8=new A.vH("Map colors identify the opportunity: amber for roofing, red for fire, purple for storms, blue for flood/FEMA, green for solar or investment, and cyan for commercial or development.",B.t2,"See different opportunities instantly")
B.auc=new A.vH("Opportunity score ranks potential. Confidence measures evidence reliability. \u201cWhy this property,\u201d \u201cWhy now,\u201d evidence counts, and a suggested next action explain every lead.",B.kV,"Understand why\u2014without jargon")
B.aua=new A.vH("Save an opportunity, choose a lead stage, add a preset or custom note, and schedule the next action. My Work keeps the pipeline and calendar together.",B.A_,"Turn intelligence into work")
B.au7=new A.vH("Choose which alerts you want. BridgePoint refreshes in the background and keeps your Daily Brief and notification history synchronized across devices.",B.kD,"Stay ahead automatically")
B.agN=s([B.aud,B.au8,B.auc,B.aua,B.au7],A.aJ("J<+body,icon,title(l,I,l)>"))
